#question(title: [Proof feedback])[
  + Is the structure of the proof correct?  \
     (First fix $epsilon$, then choose
     $delta$, then ...)
  + Did you say exactly what $delta$ is?
  + Is the proof self-contained?  \
     (I do not need to read the rough work)
  + Are all variables defined? In the right
    order?
  + Do all steps follow logically from what
    comes before?  \
     Do you start from what you know and
     prove what you have to prove?
  + Are you proving your conclusion or
    assuming it?
]
